<section data-mw-section-id="6" id="mwAdY" aria-labelledby="The_Bachelor"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="The_Bachelor"><i id="mwAdc">The Bachelor</i></h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=The_Bachelorette_(American_TV_series)_season_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6" title="Edit section: The Bachelor"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

<p id="mwAdg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joey_Graziadei" title="Joey Graziadei" id="mwAdk">Joey Graziadei</a> was chosen as the lead for <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bachelor_(American_season_28)" title="The Bachelor (American season 28)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAdo">season 28</a> of <i id="mwAds"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bachelor_(American_TV_series)" title="The Bachelor (American TV series)" id="mwAdw">The Bachelor</a></i>.<sup about="#mwt152" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-45" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-45"}}'><a href="#cite_note-45" id="mwAd0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAd4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAd8">[</span>44<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAeA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="7" id="mwAeE" aria-labelledby="Bachelor_in_Paradise"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Bachelor_in_Paradise"><i id="mwAeI">Bachelor in Paradise</i></h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=The_Bachelorette_(American_TV_series)_season_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7" title="Edit section: Bachelor in Paradise"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwAeM"><b id="mwAeQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bachelor_in_Paradise_(American_season_9)" title="Bachelor in Paradise (American season 9)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAeU">Season 9</a></b></p> 

<p id="mwAeY">Aaron Bryant, Aaron Schwartzman, Brayden Bowers, John Buresh, John Henry Spurlock, Michael Barbour, Peter Cappio, Sean McLaughlin, Tanner Courtad, and Taylor Pegg returned for season 9 of <i id="mwAec"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bachelor_in_Paradise_(American_TV_series)" title="Bachelor in Paradise (American TV series)" id="mwAeg">Bachelor in Paradise</a></i>.<sup about="#mwt155" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-46" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-46"}}'><a href="#cite_note-46" id="mwAek"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAeo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAes">[</span>45<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAew">]</span></span></a></sup> Buresh, McLaughlin, and Schwartzmann were eliminated in week 2. Bowers and Pegg were eliminated in week 4. Courtad split from Jess Girod, Cappio split from Sam Picco, and Barbour split from Olivia Lewis in week 5. Bryant and Spurlock got engaged to Eliza Isichei and Kat Izzo, respectively, in week 5.</p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="8" id="mwAe0" aria-labelledby="Bachelor_in_Paradise_2"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Bachelor_in_Paradise_2"><i id="mwAe4">Bachelor in Paradise</i></h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=The_Bachelorette_(American_TV_series)_season_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8" title="Edit section: Bachelor in Paradise"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwAe8"><b id="mwAfA"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bachelor_in_Paradise_(American_season_10)" title="Bachelor in Paradise (American season 10)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAfE">Season 10</a></b></p> 

<p id="mwAfI">McLaughlin returned for Season 10. He was eliminated and left in a relationship with Allyshia Gupta in week 7.<sup about="#mwt158" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-47" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-47"}}'><a href="#cite_note-47" id="mwAfM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAfQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAfU">[</span>46<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAfY">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="9" id="mwAfc" aria-labelledby="Dancing_with_the_Stars"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Dancing_with_the_Stars"><i id="mwAfg">Dancing with the Stars</i></h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=The_Bachelorette_(American_TV_series)_season_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9" title="Edit section: Dancing with the Stars"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

<p id="mwAfk"><b id="mwAfo"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dancing_with_the_Stars_(American_season_32)" title="Dancing with the Stars (American season 32)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAfs">Season 32</a></b></p> 

<p id="mwAfw">Charity Lawson competed in season 32 of <i id="mwAf0"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dancing_with_the_Stars_(American_TV_series)" title="Dancing with the Stars (American TV series)" id="mwAf4">Dancing with the Stars</a></i> where she partnered with <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artem_Chigvintsev" title="Artem Chigvintsev" id="mwAf8">Artem Chigvintsev</a>.<sup about="#mwt161" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-48" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-48"}}'><a href="#cite_note-48" id="mwAgA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAgE"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAgI">[</span>47<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAgM">]</span></span></a></sup> They finished in fourth place.</p>

<p id="mwAgQ"><b id="mwAgU"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dancing_with_the_Stars_(American_season_33)" title="Dancing with the Stars (American season 33)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAgY">Season 33</a></b></p> 

<p id="mwAgc">Joey Graziadei competed in, and won, season 33 of <i id="mwAgg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dancing_with_the_Stars_(American_TV_series)" title="Dancing with the Stars (American TV series)" id="mwAgk">Dancing with the Stars</a></i> with his partner <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jenna_Johnson_(dancer)" title="Jenna Johnson (dancer)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAgo">Jenna Johnson</a>.<sup about="#mwt164" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-49" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-49"}}'><a href="#cite_note-49" id="mwAgs"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAgw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAg0">[</span>48<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAg4">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="10" id="mwAg8" aria-labelledby="The_Traitors"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="The_Traitors"><i id="mwAhA">The Traitors</i></h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=The_Bachelorette_(American_TV_series)_season_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10" title="Edit section: The Traitors"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwAhE">In 2026, Graziadei competed on the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Traitors_(American_TV_series)_season_6" title="The Traitors (American TV series) season 6" id="mwAhI">sixth season</a> of <i id="mwAhM"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Traitors_(American_TV_series)" title="The Traitors (American TV series)" id="mwAhQ">The Traitors</a></i>.<sup about="#mwt167" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-50" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-50"}}'><a href="#cite_note-50" id="mwAhU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAhY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhc">[</span>49<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

